<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">These colorful Vietnamese-inspired 25 Minut=
e Ginger Sesame Banh Mi Rice Bowls are full of fresh flavors and made so si=
mply. The ground chicken, or pork, is cooked in a sweet soy chili sauce unt=
il caramelized around the edges. It=E2=80=99s then added to bowls of lemong=
rass rice. A fresh, bright, cucumber herb salad with chunks of avocado is s=
pooned overtop along with quickly pickled carrots. There=E2=80=99s spicy ma=
yo and extra sauce too. It=E2=80=99s a very yummy balance of spicy, sweet, =
and savory flavors. Altogether, these bowls are so delicious, plus quick to=
 make.</p>



