<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">If you=E2=80=99re not familiar with a Banh =
Mi sandwich, it=E2=80=99s a Vietnamese sandwich. It=E2=80=99s usually made =
with a baguette-style sub roll that=E2=80=99s layered with cripy pork or ch=
icken. Then a spicy mayo is spread on top with pickled veggies, cucumbers, =
spicy chilies, and fresh herbs. It=E2=80=99s also traditional to add liver =
pate, but you=E2=80=99ll notice I left that out of these bowls. It=E2=80=99=
s not something I can easily find.</p><div id=3D"cls-video-container-WcgXmw=
Vs" class=3D"adthrive" style=3D"min-height: 464px;"><div></div></div>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">The flavors combined are fresh, with just t=
he right amount of spiciness, and great umami flavors all around.</p><div i=
