<h3 class=3D"wp-block-heading">The details on these bowls</h3>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">To start, I do make my own lemongrass rice.=
 It=E2=80=99s super simple but totally optional.</p><div id=3D"AdThrive_Con=
tent_3_desktop" class=3D"adthrive-ad adthrive-sticky-container adthrive-con=
tent adthrive-content-3"></div>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">Lemongrass is such a star ingredient that=
=E2=80=99s so underused. When cooked, it has a subtle citrusy, lemony flavo=
r with a bit of mintiness in there too.</p>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">It=E2=80=99s a very light refreshing flavor=
 and I love cooking it into the rice. The lemongrass really compliments the=
se bowls.</p>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">I cook the rice in coconut milk for a cream=
y, coconut flavor along with lemongrass paste and Thai jasmine rice. Simply=
 let the rice steam while you prepare the bowls.</p><div id=3D"AdThrive_Con=
tent_4_desktop" class=3D"adthrive-ad adthrive-sticky-container adthrive-con=
tent adthrive-content-4"></div>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">While that=E2=80=99s cooking away, I make t=
he cucumber salad.</p>



