<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">Lots of fresh herbs, I use a mix of cilantr=
o and Thai basil. If you enjoy mint, add that too! Then, refreshing cucumbe=
r, avocado, toasted sesame seeds, roasted peanuts, a little spice from a se=
rrano pepper, and a simple lime dressing.</p><div id=3D"AdThrive_Content_5_=
desktop" class=3D"adthrive-ad adthrive-sticky-container adthrive-content ad=
thrive-content-5"></div>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">Just toss everything together in a bowl, no=
 fancy steps.</p>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">And now the meat. You can use chicken or po=
rk, I usually do a mix of the two. Then a couple of shallots and garlic. Th=
en add chili paste, tamari or soy, fish sauce, and maple syrup. Oh, plus so=
me black pepper.</p>



