<h3 class=3D"wp-block-heading" id=3D"h-finish-it-up">Finish it up</h3>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">Layer each bowl with lots of rice, then the=
 meat, and any extra sauce. Top each bowl with the cucumber salad and spicy=
 mayo.</p><div id=3D"AdThrive_Content_7_desktop" class=3D"adthrive-ad adthr=
ive-sticky-container adthrive-content adthrive-content-7"></div>



<p class=3D"wp-block-paragraph">Enjoy immediately=E2=80=A6and that=E2=80=99=
s it! This takes less than 30 minutes to make and it=E2=80=99s delicious an=
d fun! All those fresh herbs really make the difference.</p>



