=3D"min-height: 250px;"></div><span style=3D"display: block;"><em><strong>P=
ickled Carrots:</strong></em> In a bowl, mix 1/2 cup rice vinegar, 1/4 cup =
maple syrup or honey, 1 tablespoon toasted sesame oil, and 1 teaspoon salt.=
 Microwave 1 minute, then whisk. Add 2 cups julienned carrots and toss well=
. Let sit 15 minutes to 1 hour. You can also add thinly sliced ginger and o=
r jalape=C3=B1os.&nbsp;</span><div class=3D"wprm-spacer"></div>
<span style=3D"display: block;"><em><strong>LEMONGRASS RICE:</strong> </em>=
Add 1 can coconut milk and 1/3 water to a medium-sized pot. Bring to a low =
boil. Add in 1 1/2 cups jasmine rice and 1 tablespoon lemongrass paste. Sti=
r to combine. Place the lid on the pot and turn the heat down to the lowest=
 setting possible. Allow the rice to cook 10 minutes on low and then turn t=
he heat off completely. Let the rice sit on the stove, covered, for another=
 15-20 minutes (don=E2=80=99t take any peeks inside!).</span><div class=3D"=
wprm-spacer"></div>
<div class=3D"wprm-recipe-instruction-text">
<span style=3D"display: block;">2. After 15-20 minutes remove the lid and f=
